{"id":"word:hebrew:H3468","type":"word","title":"יֶשַׁע","subtitle":"H3468 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"liberty , deliverance , prosperity","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יֶשַׁע (H3468) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 36 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יֶשַׁע (yeshaʻ) means liberty , deliverance , prosperity First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 35."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יֶשַׁע","transliteration":"yeshaʻ","pronunciation":"yeh'-shah","strong":"H3468","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3468","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["יִשְׁעִֽ/י","יִשְׁעֶ֑/ךָ","יִשְׁעִ֑/י","יִשְׁעֵ֑/נוּ","יִשְׁעֵ֔/נוּ"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",11],["HNcmsc/Sp1cp",5],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",4],["HNcmsa",4],["HR/Ncmsa",3],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HNcmsc/Sp2fs",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HNcmsc",1],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp1cs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"liberty , deliverance , prosperity","usage":"safety, salvation, saving.","full":"H3468. yesha יֵ֫שַׁע noun masculine Isa 51:5 deliverance, rescue, salvation , also safety, welfare ; — יֵ֫שַׁע Psa 20:7 4 t.; יֶ֫שַׁע Job 5:11 4 t.; suffix יִשְׁעִי 2Sam 22:3 11 t., + 14 t. suffixes; — 1 safety, welfare, prosperity 2Sam 23:5 ; Psa 12:6 ; Job 5:4 , 11 . 2 salvation , i.e. primarily physical rescue, by God, often with added spiritual idea: Isa 62:11 ; Psa 69:14 ; 85:8 ; 85:10 ; אֱלֹהִים יֵשַׁע salvation from God 50:23 ; used as infin. with accusative לְיֵשַׁע Hab 3:13 (twice in verse) (see Ew § 239 a ); accordingly Yahweh is וְיִשְׁעִי אוֺרִי my light and my salvation Psa 27:1 ; ישׁע צוּר 95:1 ; ישׁע קֶרֶן 18:3 = 2Sam 22:3 ; ישׁע אֱלֹהֵי Isa 17:10 ; Micah 7:7 ; Hab 3:18 ; Psa 18:47 = ישׁע צוּר אֱלֹהֵי 2Sam 22:47 ; Psa 24:5 ; 25:5 ; 27:9 ; 65:6 ; 79:9 ; 85:5 ; 1Chr 16:35 ; ישׁ ׳מָגֵן Psa 18:36 = 2Sam 22:36 ; ישׁעי אלהים על Psa 62:8 ; || צְדָקָה Isa 45:8 ; 51:5 ; 61:10 ; יִשְׁעֶ֑ךָ שְׂשׂוֺן Psa 51:14 joy of thy salvation ישׁ אַלְבִּישׁ ׳כֹּהֲנֶיהָ 132:16 her priests will clothe with salvation. 3 victory: יְמִינוֺ יֵשַׁע גְּבוּרוֺת Psa 20:7 the mighty deeds of the victory of his right hand.","rootNote":"or יֵשַׁע ; from 3467 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 35","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 35","2Sam 22 3","2Sam 22 36","2Sam 22 47","2Sam 23 5","Hab 3 13","Hab 3 13","Hab 3 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 35","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":35,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעֵ֔/נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cp"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 3","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעִ֗/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 36","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעֶ֑/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 47","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":47,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעִֽ/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"2Sam 23 5","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעִ֥/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Hab 3 13","book":"Hab","chapter":3,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/יֵ֣שַׁע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Hab 3 13","book":"Hab","chapter":3,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/יֵ֖שַׁע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Hab 3 18","book":"Hab","chapter":3,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעִֽ/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Isa 17 10","book":"Isa","chapter":17,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִשְׁעֵ֔/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"Isa 45 8","book":"Isa","chapter":45,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יֶ֗שַׁע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 51 5","book"